{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】行政長官李家超出發訪問北京和上海。</p>\n<p>行政長官李家超早上抵達機場，他會先到北京出席周三上午舉行的京港治談會開幕式，並與北京市官員會面；同日轉往上海，周四出席進博會開幕式，並在虹橋國際經濟論壇致辭，周五返港。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T05:03:28.488668+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T04:19:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T04:59:18.512980+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T04:59:18.512980+00:00","content_hash":"e46702e1fcbea59498e1c5bbdf8b43ef4b4e46513403a02fab44084720746cb4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}